{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretoneGear-6910": "MAN: 有艘飞空艇坠毁了，掏点钱，我们捡回来的东西就归你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretoneInn-6911": "Innkeeper: 想住店的人太多，一晚得一百七十瓦尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretoneInn-6912": "住店休息",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretoneInn-6913": "Innkeeper: 带够现钱再来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretoneInn-6914": "不用了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-survMomN-6915": "WOMAN: 别管我！去找我的孩子！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDoorPacerBefore-6916": "MAN: 她去哪儿了……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeGirlfriend-6917": "WOMAN: 我妈妈……她的房子都烧成灰了，我想她应该早就离开了，但愿如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDoorPacerAfter-6918": "MAN: 她一定早就离开了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneOfficer2-6919": "OFFICER: 都冷静点，这里已经够忙了，别再添乱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeWestWomanA-6920": "WOMAN: 我所有的东西……就这么，全没了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeWestManB-6921": "MAN: 我的家人正在乡下度假，至少这点还能让我安心些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneOfficer1a-6922": "OFFICER: 队伍就只能走这么快，等着轮到你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDrinksEast-6923": "WOMAN: 那些拿枪的人！到底是从哪儿冒出来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDrinksWest-6924": "MAN: 趁这里还没被炸上天，赶紧喝点缓缓。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDrinks3-6925": "MAN: 嘴里的烟味怎么都散不掉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDrinks2-6926": "WOMAN: 我只盼自己别昏过去，这里可没人顾得上把我救醒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeDrinks1-6927": "WOMAN: 我还是喘不上气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-drinksOfficer-6928": "OFFICER: 一个一个来，每人一份。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeSittingWoman2-6929": "WOMAN: 房子……还有里面的一切！幸好乡下还有座庄园。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeSittingBoy-6930": "BOY: 爸爸什么时候回来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeSittingWoman1-6931": "WOMAN: 我听得见其他仆人在瓦砾底下惨叫，可我什么也做不了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastRefugeWoman2-6932": "WOMAN: 他们不是人，是披着人皮的怪物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastRefugeGirl1-6933": "GIRL: 他们大喊大叫，可我听不懂他们在说什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastRefugeWoman-6934": "WOMAN: 我的丈夫……所有男人……他们把人排成一列，然后就……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastRefugeMan1-6935": "MAN: 我也没做什么特别的事，怎么就只有我活了下来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneOfficer1-6936": "OFFICER: 你们要打头阵？换我可不敢，我从没想过会亲眼见到这样的灾难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneBoyA-6937": "BOY: 我们接下来去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneGirlA-6938": "GIRL: 哪儿也去不了，笨蛋！东西和人全烧光了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneGrandma-6939": "WOMAN: 不许说这种话，我们都得撑下去，撑到这一切结束。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeEtable2-6940": "MAN: 我还以为只有老爷们和女人能过来，根本轮不到我呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeEtable1-6941": "MAN: 哈！等这事过去，总得有人铲煤吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeOfficer1-6942": "OFFICER: 手都规矩点，出了这样的事，也不能不守法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeBoy-6943": "BOY: 我正睡着呢，等反应过来，已经飞出窗户了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeGirl-6944": "GIRL: 火好烫，可我没有被烧伤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeGrandpa-6945": "OLD MAN: 孩子们出生以后，我每晚都会给他们施一道防护咒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeGrandpa-6946": "OLD MAN: 当年我祖父也是这么护着我的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeYoungWoman-6947": "WOMAN: 我丈夫又跑回了屋里，然后……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeOldWoman-6948": "OLD WOMAN: 我从没想过，他会走在我前面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeGirl-6949": "GIRL: 我要爸爸回来！让他回来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeMan1-6950": "MAN: 爆炸之后我是怎么来到这里的，已经完全记不清了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-refugeMan1a-6951": "MAN: 去我妈妈家的那条街……全是火。我没办法……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-entryRefugeOfficer-6952": "OFFICER: 都冷静点，按顺序来！多谢配合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRescueOfficerExt-6953": "OFFICER: 快进去，动作利索点！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westBreather-6954": "MAN: 我只是出来透口气，他们说只要不出院子就安全。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRescueExtWoman-6955": "WOMAN: 我的家……所有东西，一下子就烧没了。浓烟里，我怎么也找不到老母亲……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-leonaTalker-6956": "LEONA: 我们就在你们后面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-leonaTalker-6957": "LEONA: 丫头，别让我逮到你犯傻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeGirl2-6958": "GIRL: 我们以后就住这儿了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeBoy2-6959": "BOY: 我还想再飞一次！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-westRefugeGrandma-6960": "OLD WOMAN: 今天醒来的时候，哪能想到会发生这些事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneRescuedOfficer-6961": "OFFICER: 把人都带进来，没时间耽搁了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-wardingProf-6962": "PROFESSOR: 不用管我，我只是检查一下防护咒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastExtSurv2-6963": "MAN: 可是房子、书，还有银器……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastExtSurv1-6964": "WOMAN: 那些都不重要，只要你和你姐妹一家都平安就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneExtKid1-6965": "BOY: 就不能去个没这么多烟的地方吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneExtKid2-6966": "GIRL: 爸爸说他马上就回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-everyoneExtPacer-6967": "MAN: 但愿他们坐的火车没进城就停下了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-interiorProfessor-6968": "PROFESSOR: 给幸存者清出道路后，就来告诉我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-eastExtSurv3-6969": "WOMAN: 我以为自己死定了。还有那么多事没来得及做……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-officerSouth1-6970": "OFFICER: 训练可没教过怎么应付这种事……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-gordonDiacon-6971": "GORDON: 幸存者由我照顾，你们去做该做的事吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-girlDiacon-6972": "GIRL: 他们抓走我，还吼我……可我什么都没做……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10hsWoman1-6973": "WOMAN: 我还是会梦见炸弹落下来，然后就是那些光束。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10shopHawker-6974": "MAN: 想买点什么？我们把货品全换了一遍。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10shopHawker-6975": "MAN: 要是想保护家人，来我们这儿添置装备就对了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10schoolBoy-6976": "BOY: 学校被炸了，我一点都不难过，反正我讨厌那个地方，可现在连兽苑都关了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10hsMother-6977": "WOMAN: 我还以为永远失去她了，出了那件事，我几乎不敢让她离开我的视线。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10closeGirl-6978": "GIRL: 妈妈老盯着我！她说发生了不好的事，可我一点也不记得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10hsOfficer-6979": "OFFICER: 都快点走，大家都还有事要忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10amazedGuy-6980": "MAN: 刚刚眼前还到处是烟，一转眼，我就好端端地站在街上了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6981": "RICH MAN: 这处房产在火里倒没受太大损失，可惜其他几处就没这么走运了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6982": "RICH MAN: 哎呀！这是真正的神谕牌？能否赏脸来一局？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6983": "不了，谢谢",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6984": "来一局！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6985": "RICH MAN: 真没想到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6986": "RICH MAN: 愿赌服输，收下这个吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6987": "获得红宝石戒指！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10propertyGuy-6988": "RICH MAN: 啊……你我都打得不错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-c10runningBoy-6989": "BOY: 我跑得比炸弹还快，一口气就跑出了城！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-leorniaGearCh10-6990": "SHOP KEEP: 专门为你们准备了新货！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-leorniaItem2-6991": "SHOP KEEP: 必需品备得足足的！全城就数我这儿最齐全！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-hideaway1-6992": "MAN: 从左边那儿走，就能到迪亚孔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-hideaway2-6993": "MAN: 不知道他们有没有发现那条通道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-hideaway3-6994": "RICH MAN: 不管“他们”究竟是谁，总算有人站出来反抗了，真让人松了口气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-staff1-6995": "STAFF: 花园如今什么样，想必您也猜得到，还是改日再来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-staff2-6996": "STAFF: 重建的活儿堆成山，你还想着逛花园？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-leoEntranceAttendant-6997": "STAFF: 重建还在进行，不过应该又有些街道能通行了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-ch11rubbleWorkerA-6998": "WORKER: 脚下当心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-ch11rubbleWorkerB-6999": "WORKER: 至少路在慢慢清出来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-hideAwayGirl-7000": "GIRL: 我们还能再见到爸爸吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-hideAwayMom-7001": "MOTHER: 嘘……会没事的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-breakoutMan-7002": "MAN: 太感谢你们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-breakoutWoman-7003": "WOMAN: 谢谢……谢谢你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-breakoutGirl-7004": "GIRL: 一切都会好起来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-breakoutBoy-7005": "BOY: 我看到那边还有人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-breakoutLady-7006": "WOMAN: 吓死我了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-breakoutGrandma-7007": "OLD WOMAN: 哎哟，天哪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness1-7008": "WOMAN: 这到底是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness1-7009": "WOMAN: 这到底是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness2-7010": "MAN: 那些飞空艇从哪儿来的？谁能有那种东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness2-7011": "MAN: 那些飞空艇从哪儿来的？谁能有那种东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness3-7012": "OLD WOMAN: 我儿子一家住在首都，可我不知道能做些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness3-7013": "OLD WOMAN: 我儿子一家住在首都，可我不知道能做些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor2-7014": "BOY: 我要爸爸！我要他现在就过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor2-7015": "BOY: 我要爸爸！我要他现在就过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor1-7016": "WOMAN: 我保证，爸爸一有办法就会来这里找我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor1-7017": "WOMAN: 我保证，爸爸一有办法就会来这里找我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor4-7018": "MAN: 我刚走出店门，转眼间，整间店就烧了起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor4-7019": "MAN: 我刚走出店门，转眼间，整间店就烧了起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor3-7020": "OLD MAN: 火车停下后，我们下车一看，前面十二节车厢都成了冒烟的残骸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor3-7021": "OLD MAN: 火车停下后，我们下车一看，前面十二节车厢都成了冒烟的残骸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor5-7022": "OLD WOMAN: 我们从火车那里一路走到这儿。哎哟，脚疼死了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor5-7023": "OLD WOMAN: 我们从火车那里一路走到这儿。哎哟，脚疼死了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer1-7024": "OFFICER: 好，继续往公园里走，后面还有人要来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer1-7025": "OFFICER: 好，继续往公园里走，后面还有人要来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWatcher-7026": "MAN: 怎么回事？整个首都的人都要从这儿踩过去吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWatcher-7027": "MAN: 怎么回事？整个首都的人都要从这儿踩过去吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer2-7028": "OFFICER: 这边走，和你们失散的人能来这里找到你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer2-7029": "OFFICER: 这边走，和你们失散的人能来这里找到你们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer0-7030": "OFFICER: 等等，你们不是从首都来的？那我劝你们也别往那边走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer0-7031": "OFFICER: 首都的无线电和魔法通讯都没了回应，我们派去的信使也一个都没回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer0-7032": "OFFICER: 等等，你们不是从首都来的？那我劝你们也别往那边走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer0-7033": "OFFICER: 首都的无线电和魔法通讯都没了回应，我们派去的信使也一个都没回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor6-7034": "MAN: 有人看见他们从哪儿来的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor6-7035": "MAN: 有人看见他们从哪儿来的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor7-7036": "MAN: 我真看见了，那些飞空艇飞过海峡，往西北去了，一开始我都不敢相信自己的眼睛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor7-7037": "MAN: 我真看见了，那些飞空艇飞过海峡，往西北去了，一开始我都不敢相信自己的眼睛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor8-7038": "MAN: 水魔法不可能让那种东西浮起来，以前有人试过的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor8-7039": "MAN: 水魔法不可能让那种东西浮起来，以前有人试过的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9-7040": "MAN: 我现在有时还会在夜里惊醒，好在到头来，我们损失的只有房子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9-7041": "MAN: 我不知道该怎么告诉他们。我只是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9a-7042": "GIRL: 好无聊啊，什么时候才能再见到那些女孩子？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9a-7043": "GIRL: 妈妈什么时候来找我们？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9b-7044": "BOY: 但愿他们永远别重建学校！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9b-7045": "BOY: 那是不是就不用上学了？能放多久的假？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness4-7046": "OLD MAN: 见过那一切以后，每天早上醒来，竟觉得有点不过瘾！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness4-7047": "OLD MAN: 活了这么多年，从没见过如此混乱又神奇的场面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness4-7048": "OLD MAN: 我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonWitness5-7049": "OLD WOMAN: 总该有人能做些什么吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-ch10worker1-7050": "WORKER: 乱？你真该看看几周前这里是什么样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-ch10worker2-7051": "WORKER: 嗯？不是，工钱是议会付的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-ch10worker3-7052": "WORKER: 不管你是谁，能让让吗？我们忙着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor10-7053": "WOMAN: 我们的女婿，他……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor11-7054": "MAN: 他叫我们先走，我们也没有别的办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor12-7055": "WOMAN: 他会来的，一定会。他说了会跟过来的……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonLocalGuy-7056": "MAN: 去店后面可得小心，有几只野兽被火赶到这里，正发狂呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonLocalGuy-7057": "MAN: 我们这里都没着火，可到现在也没恢复正常。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonResident1-7058": "WOMAN: 真没想到，这才过去多久，大家就都不再去想那件事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonResident1a-7059": "GIRL: 城里的公园都还堆满了瓦砾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonResident2-7060": "MAN: 人到我这把年纪，早就懂得每一天都值得珍惜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonResident2-7061": "MAN: 至少现在，大家也都能体会到这一点了。看着他们这样，我很高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonResident3-7062": "WOMAN: 我也不想抱怨，可鸟儿到现在还没回来，一定是吓坏了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9c-7063": "WOMAN: 其他人都还惊魂未定，一直忘不了那天发生的事……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor9c-7064": "WOMAN: 可我当时还在照常过日子，一回过神来，就已经被那道不似人间的光包围了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonOfficer2a-7065": "OFFICER: 都打起精神来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBarOfficer-7066": "OFFICER: 就算外面出了这样的灾难，也不是你们在这儿闹事的借口，我可盯着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBarWorried2-7067": "MAN: 我们什么也做不了，谁都不知道该怎么应付这种事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBarWorried1-7068": "WOMAN: 店里其他人怎么办？我姐妹和她的孩子们怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBar3-7069": "MAN: 今天出城，真是出对了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBar3-7070": "MAN: 重建我们的工厂，得花上好几个星期。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonPiano-7071": "MAN: 这种时候弹琴，不知道合不合适。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonPiano-7072": "MAN: 想听什么曲子？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBar1-7073": "MAN: 什么时候都适合来上一大杯啤酒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBar1-7074": "MAN: 好事也好，坏事也罢，来上一大杯啤酒总没错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBar2-7075": "MAN: 坐在这儿，我心里也过意不去。可还能干什么？往火里跑吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonBarLater-7076": "MAN: 现在做盖房子的生意，正是好时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10npcs.yarn-iretonSurvivor5a-7077": "MAN: 我总觉得下一刻就会醒来，发现只是被子盖得太多了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-fireMinigame_setCameraHint-7577": "剩余 1 次",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-fireMinigame_setCameraHint-7578": "剩余 {0} 次",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-leornia_check_fire_game-7579": "扑灭这处火焰？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-leornia_check_fire_game-7580": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-leornia_check_fire_game-7581": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-fireMinigame_failMessage-7582": "NIKOLAI: 还没找到人，灭火器就用光了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-fireMinigame_failWarningMessage-7583": "NIKOLAI: 灭火器的使用次数有限，小心点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/fireMinigameCh10.yarn-firstFireStopper2-7584": "WOMAN: 求求你们！没别人能帮我们了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7585": "CORDELIA: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7586": "生命汲取",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7587": "需要帮忙吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7588": "CORDELIA: 你们想见识致命的魔法，是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7589": "血肉化琉璃",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7590": "别忘了还有我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7591": "CORDELIA: 那就让你们见识死亡与毁灭。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7592": "夺魂",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7593": "CORDELIA: 你们对禁术根本一无所知！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7594": "审判之眼",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7595": "OFFICER: 全体撤退！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7596": "OFFICER: 来人，支援我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7597": "OFFICER: 增援！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-ch10GordonBattle-7598": "OFFICER: 快过来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter10/chapter10battles.yarn-diaconBeamBattle_interrupt-7599": "NIKOLAI: 那个古老的法术……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3406": "Title: 莱奥尼亚之战",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3407": "Description: 从南面进入首都，尽力提供援助。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3408": "Title: 全员撤离！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3409": "Description: 进入民宅，救出平民！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3410": "Title: 向北城区进发",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3411": "Description: 继续向北，寻找更多幸存者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3412": "Title: 二十名幸存者",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3413": "Description: 在大学街的东西两端寻找二十名幸存者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3414": "Title: 重返校园",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3415": "Description: 返回大学，向蕾欧娜汇报。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3416": "Title: 大家一起走",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3417": "Description: 将幸存者向北疏散至火车站。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3418": "Title: 发起反击",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3419": "Description: 带领科黛莉娅的小队穿过仓库，登上火焰战舰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3420": "Title: 直捣敌阵",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3421": "Description: 尼古拉率队前往迪亚孔！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3422": "Title: 铁石心肠之人",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3423": "Description: 在迪亚孔控制室迎战冯·罗尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3424": "Title: 一点小惊喜",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3425": "Description: 前往东面的火车站，登上专列。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3426": "Title: 世界在等着我们",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3427": "Description: 与同伴交谈，发现可选任务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3428": "Title: 一切的起点",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3429": "Description: 前往大陆中央的尼巴罗斯山顶，与乌拉尔特总理对决。"
}
